abstract: "AsiBackbone 5.2.0 is a backward-compatible minor release for the stable 5.x line. It adds a fluent policy-evaluator builder, begins the ASIB900 deprecation window for partial evaluator constructors planned for removal in 6.0, and strengthens package compatibility, durable release evidence, quality gates, and project stewardship. Package IDs, public namespaces, the net10.0 target, and AssemblyVersion 5.0.0.0 remain unchanged."
